  (text "TPS552892 Rev A application 9-36 V to 12 V / 3 A. 8 A is inductor-current capability, not output rating.\nInitial compensation below is calculated for 100 uF effective Cout; actual part bias/ESR must be checked.\nCarrier pinout, hardware shutdown/wake sequencing and transient hold-up remain release tasks."
